        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 7811, Floor Spring Hinge Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHorizontal type double action floor spring hinge set  includes  top pivot, side plates, back plate, and wood screws. Double action spring hinges are typically used on restaurant doors or bar doors that open in both directions and require self closing. Includes Top pivot and  side trim plates. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/bommer-floor-hinge.gif?v=1704354516\" width=\"580\" height=\"500\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer Floor Spring Hinge\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis floor spring hinge is for use on 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick doors up to 90 pounds. Adjustable tension spring  allow you to determine how much closing force you apply to the door (how hard/fast the door self closes). Includes adjustment tool. Made in the USA.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available: For heavier doors use <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-floor-spring-hinge-set-bommer-7813hd\"><b>Bommer 7813HD Heavy Duty Floor Spring Hinge</b></a> and for Non-Hold Open use <a href=\"/products/horizontal-floor-spring-hinge-set-bommer-7813\"><b>Bommer 7813 Standard Duty Floor Spring Hinge</b></a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Bommer 7811 Horizontal Spring Hinge Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Spring Hinge: 9-1/4\" Long</li>\r\n<li>Cover Plate Length: 9-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Cover Plate Height: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Weight: 90 Lbs. Maximum</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n<li>Door Width: 36\" Maximum</li>\r\n<li>Anti Friction Bearing </li>\r\n<li>Double-acting (swings in both directions)</li>\r\n<li>Hold Open at Approximately 85 Degrees</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Spring Tension</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BOM-7811-Specification.pdf?v=1691094998\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 7811 Horizontal Floor Spring Hinge with Hold Open Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Set</b> (Enough to do one door).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued.  <p>\r\nDirect Fit Replacement Available: <a href=\"/products/floor-spring-hinge-set-deltana-dash95\"><b>Floor Spring Hinge Set, Deltana DASH95</b></a>\r\n</p></b>\r\n<br><br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
